plan.prompt:
Stage: port-plan. Read .studio/project.json, design/GDD.md and the game's code. Write design/port-{{input.target}}.md: the source engine and the target ({{input.target}}), each system and how it maps (input map, scenes and states, physics numbers, levels, UI, sounds), the assets to import and how (2D sheets and tiles as they are; 3D .glb through the target's asset.import; levels from their level.json rows), what the target does differently, the state the bots read (the same names: player, score, won, targets), and the playtest goal and checks that must pass in both. Record the original's latest playtest id.
Notes: {{input.notes}}
Feedback, if any: {{feedback}}
